「你有沒有結帳？」\n\u200b當下真的超級傻眼，這種問法非常失禮。貴店不是有裝監視器嗎？如果怕有人吃霸王餐，監視器是裝好看的嗎？為什麼不先去調監視器確認，而是直接跑來質疑客人？\n\u200b我知道無人拉麵店經營不容易，但這種完全不尊重人的管理方式真的讓人很感冒。明明有乖乖付錢，卻要被當成小偷一樣盤問，用餐心情全部被毀了。請貴店加強員工訓練，要質疑人之前請先拿出證據好嗎？",null,[0,227]]]],[],[null,null,557,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWcU1UTkVOVzE1ZDFkMVVuQkhiVjlLUWxWRVZuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x2034dd299224b6e1!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkVqMTNENW15d1d1UnBHbV9KQlVEVnc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWcU1UTkVOVzE1ZDFkMVVuQkhiVjlLUWxWRVZuYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWcU1UTkVOVzE1ZDFkMVVuQkhiVjlLUWxWRVZuYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWcU1UTkVOVzE1ZDFkMVVuQkhiVjlLUWxWRVZuYxILMGR4WV9oakNuZ08aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rVnFNVE5FTlcxNWQxZDFVbkJIYlY5S1FsVkVWbmMSCzBkeFlfaGpDbmdPIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR4bYkkindNCAqCzBkeFlfaGpDbmdP\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiXhOLc9dmWAxU-oa8BHfdZJBQQoykIhAEoBQ"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwj7m-bc9dmWAxXd74sBHbDBH_MQ0pMFCEMoBA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiXhOLc9dmWAxU-oa8BHfdZJBQQ0pMFCH0oBA"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twRExYcERiVGg1UTNwME5rZGZPVmRoZG05V2FuYxAB",["0x0:0x2034dd299224b6e1",null,1763095544933965,1763095544933965,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114731356918382840758/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["UP Chen","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWy4pRntmIkeQn31UO-OXY7DVWaX9POxsTuIx1sS99Fj-gzDmF9Dg\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114731356918382840758?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"114731356918382840758",null,16,9,null,[1,4,1],6,["在地嚮導 · 16 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwiXhOLc9dmWAxU-oa8BHfdZJBQQpr8GCIYBKAA"]]]],null,"9 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[4],null,[["CIABIhDXNXcK7FI453eYlDSkeSCq",["CIABIhDXNXcK7FI453eYlDSkeSCq",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googl